<doc id="4618" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4618" title="Préféktur Fukuoka">
Préféktur Fukuoka

Perfektur Fukuoka (福岡県, Fukuoka-ken&lt;a href="Sistim%20tulis%20Jepang"&gt;?&lt;/a&gt;) ayana di &lt;a href="Island"&gt;Pulo&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kyushu"&gt;Kyushu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;. Ibukotana &lt;a href="Fukuoka%2C%20Fukuoka"&gt;Fukuoka&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Perfektur Fukuoka ngawengku &lt;a href="Old%20provinces%20of%20Japan"&gt;propinsi heubeul&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Chikugo%20Province"&gt;Chikugo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Chikuzen%20Province"&gt;Chikuzen&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Buzen%20Province"&gt;Buzen&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Geografi</h2>
Geografi.
Perfektur Fukuoka nyanghareupan laut ti tilu sisi, diwatesan ku Pefekter &lt;a href="Saga%20Prefecture"&gt;Saga&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Oita%20Prefecture"&gt;Oita&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Kumamoto%20Prefecture"&gt;Kumamoto&lt;/a&gt; sarta nyanghareupan &lt;a href="Yamaguchi%20Prefecture"&gt;Perfektur Yamaguchi&lt;/a&gt; sebrangeun &lt;a href="Kanmon%20Straits"&gt;Selat Kanmon&lt;/a&gt;.
Fukuoka kaasup dua kota gedé di Pulo &lt;a href="Kyushu"&gt;Kyushu&lt;/a&gt;, nyaéta &lt;a href="Fukuoka%2C%20Fukuoka"&gt;Fukuoka&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Kitakyushu"&gt;Kitakyushu&lt;/a&gt;, sarta kawasan industri di Kyushu. Fukuoka ogé ngawengku sababaraha &lt;a href="islands"&gt;pulo-pulo&lt;/a&gt; leutik kalereun basisir Kyushu.
<h2>Kota-kota</h2>
