<doc id="4904" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4904" title="Archimedes">
Archimedes

Archimedes (&lt;a href="Greek%20language"&gt;Basa Yunani&lt;/a&gt;: Αρχιμήδης) (c. &lt;a href="287%20BC"&gt;287 BC&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="212%20BC"&gt;212 BC&lt;/a&gt;) salah saurang ahli &lt;a href="matematika"&gt;matematika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="fisika"&gt;fisika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="r%C3%A9kayasa"&gt;rékayasa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="astronomi"&gt;astronomi&lt;/a&gt;, sarta &lt;a href="philosopher"&gt;filsuf&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Greeks"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt; lahir di koloni palabuan &lt;a href="Syracuse%2C%20Italy"&gt;Syracuse&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sicily"&gt;Sisilia&lt;/a&gt;. Archimides ku sababaraha &lt;a href="history%20of%20mathematics"&gt;ahli sajarah matematika&lt;/a&gt; dianggap salaku saurang ahli matematika nu luar biasa dina &lt;a href="antiquity"&gt;mangsa baheula&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;a href="Carl%20Friedrich%20Gauss"&gt;Carl Friedrich Gauss&lt;/a&gt; nganggap Archimides dua urang nu luar salilana (nu séjénna &lt;a href="Isaac%20Newton"&gt;Isaac Newton&lt;/a&gt;).
<h2>Penemuan jeung karya</h2>
Penemuan jeung karya.
Archimedes jadi kawentar ku hasil usahana dina "mempertahankeun" &lt;a href="Syracuse%2C%20Italy"&gt;Syracuse&lt;/a&gt; tina serangan &lt;a href="siege"&gt;tentara&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Roman%20Republic"&gt;Roma&lt;/a&gt; dina &lt;a href="Second%20Punic%20War"&gt;Perang Punic Kadua&lt;/a&gt;. Archimides dianggap ngusir Romawi di basisir maké mesin perang jieunan sorangan, nu mampu mindahkeun kapal tur babawaanna ku cara ngadorong tali &lt;a href="http%3A//www.smith.edu/hsc/museum/ancient_inventions/shipshaker2.html"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, sarta &lt;a href="discovery%20%28observation%29"&gt;manggihkeun&lt;/a&gt; prinsip &lt;a href="density"&gt;densitas&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="buoyancy"&gt;gaya apung&lt;/a&gt;, nu disebut ogé &lt;a href="prinsip%20Archimedes"&gt;prinsip Archimedes&lt;/a&gt;, waktu keur mandi. Dina sajarahna, Archimides terus lumpat ka jalan, bakat ku bungah kana pamanggih lumpat bari teu dibaju, bari ngagorowok "&lt;a href="Eureka%20%28word%29"&gt;Eureka&lt;/a&gt;!" ("Kuring geus manggihkeun!"). Archimides diaku ogé nu manggihkeun &lt;a href="odometer"&gt;odometer&lt;/a&gt; dina &lt;a href="First%20Punic%20War"&gt;Perang Punic Kahiji&lt;/a&gt;. Pamanggihna dipaké keur pertahanan militer Syracuse ngalawan invasi Roma disebut &lt;a href="claw%20of%20Archimedes"&gt;cakar Archimides&lt;/a&gt;.

