Marco Polo

Marco Polo (&lt;a href="15%20S%C3%A9pt%C3%A9mber"&gt;15 Séptémber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1254"&gt;1254&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Venice"&gt;Venice&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;a href="8%20Januari"&gt;8 Januari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1324"&gt;1324&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Venice"&gt;Venice&lt;/a&gt;) padagang &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20V%C3%A9n%C3%A9sia"&gt;Venesia&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="%C3%A9ksplorasi"&gt;penjelajah&lt;/a&gt;, bareng jeung ramana nyaéta Niccolò tur pamanna nyaéta Mafféo, urang kulon mimiti nu indit maké &lt;a href="Jalan%20Sutra"&gt;Jalan Sutra&lt;/a&gt; ka &lt;a href="China"&gt;China&lt;/a&gt; (disebut &lt;a href="Cathay"&gt;Cathay&lt;/a&gt;) sarta ngadatangan ka &lt;a href="Great%20Khan"&gt;Great Khan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kakaisaran%20Mongol"&gt;Kakaisaran Mongol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kubilai%20Khan"&gt;Kubilai Khan&lt;/a&gt; (incuna &lt;a href="Genghis%20Khan"&gt;Genghis Khan&lt;/a&gt;). Salila di jalan nulis Il Milione ("Samilyar" atawa &lt;a href="The%20Travels%20of%20Marco%20Polo"&gt;The Travels of Marco Polo&lt;/a&gt;).
